        <p class="ai-proof-sub reveal">Veloxhire.AI is our agentic AI interview platform. Built on Azure OpenAI. Maintained by the same team that builds your pipeline. If a pattern is good enough to sell, it has to be good enough for us to run.</p>
        <a class="ai-proof-btn reveal" href="https://veloxhire.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore Veloxhire.AI →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay:.1s">
        <div class="ai-card">
