    <div class="tp-header">
      <h2 class="tp-h reveal">Meet the team<br>behind the work.</h2>
      <p class="tp-sub reveal">A focused engineering team based in Ahmedabad. Specialists, not generalists — Azure, data and AI engineers who ship to production.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tp-grid">
      <div class="tp-featured tp-slot" aria-label="Team group photo placeholder"></div>
      <div class="tp-slot" aria-label="Team photo placeholder"></div>
      <div class="tp-slot" aria-label="Team photo placeholder"></div>
      <div class="tp-slot" aria-label="Team photo placeholder"></div>
      <div class="tp-slot" aria-label="Team photo placeholder"></div>
